      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a temporary void. it just feels like the only thing that actually mattered is gone. like everything else is just noise and busywork. i look around and i just dont see any reason to keep doing this cycle of caring about things only for them to be taken away. what's the point of even trying to move forward when all it leads to is this?",
